Package: mcp-server-librenms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends},
 python3-fastmcp (>= 4.1.4),
 python3-httpx2,
 python3-pydantic,
 python3-dotenv,
Provides: librenms-mcp
Description: stdio MCP server for LibreNMS network monitoring
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for LibreNMS: devices, ports, alerts,
 inventory, locations, services, logs, graphs, billing and Oxidized configs
 (113 tools). Set READ_ONLY_MODE=true to expose only read-only tools.
 Fork of mhajder/librenms-mcp.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-librenms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-librenms (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers LibreNMS MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-librenms. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-librenms binary as an available MCP server in the
 local mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
